<title>USA: Sioux City hogs $1.00-1.50 higher - USDA.</title>
<headline>Sioux City hogs $1.00-1.50 higher - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>SIOUX CITY 1997-06-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Barrows and gilts were $1.00-1.50 higher. Trade moderately active. Top $58.00 per cwt. -</p>
<p>USDA</p>
<p>US 1-3   220-270 lbs     57.50-58.00</p>
<p>	   270-280 lbs     57.00-57.50</p>
<p>US 2-3   280-300 lbs     55.00-56.50</p>
<p>US 3-4   300-330 lbs     52.00-54.50</p>
<p>Sows: 0.50 to mostly 1.00 higher. Top 48.50.</p>
<p>US 1-3   300-450 lbs	46.50</p>
<p>	   450-500 lbs	47.00-47.50</p>
<p>	   500-600 lbs	48.00</p>
<p>	   600-700 lbs	48.50</p>
</text>
